            <ArticleTitle>Bilateral styloid fracture. A case report.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>498-501</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Styloid fractures are common, and their treatment is relatively straightforward. This case demonstrated delayed healing because of continuous pathologic motion aggravating the styloid fractures.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
